				22
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Establish Wind-Air IPC delegation layer for updates and indexing\n\nIntroduce a comprehensive Tauri command suite under `Source/IPC/WindAirCommands/` to bridge the Wind frontend with the Air native daemon. This implementation exposes update management, authentication, file operations, and system metrics to the UI via gRPC.\n\nKey additions:\n- **Client Wrapper:** `AirClientWrapper` manages gRPC connections with reconnect logic and PascalCase logging.\n- **Command Handlers:** Implement `CheckForUpdates`, `DownloadUpdate`, `ApplyUpdate`, `AuthenticateUser`, `DownloadFile`, `IndexFiles`, `SearchFiles`, `GetAirStatus`, and `GetAirMetrics`.\n- **DTOs:** Define strict response types (`UpdateInfoDTO`, `DownloadResultDTO`, `SearchResultsDTO`, etc.) for serializing Air daemon responses.\n- **Registration:** `RegisterWindAirCommands` wires all 9 handlers into the Tauri builder, centralizing the IPC surface.\n\nThis layer enables the Wind frontend to offload background tasks (updates, auth, indexing) to the Air sidecar, maintaining the separation of concerns between UI logic and native background services.",
			"SHA": "bb0e43765c29626f33885b136223a4aaff0b8fdc"
		},
